# Intuit's own QuickBooks OAuth quickstart sample scaffold — a local
# reference/scratch tool, not part of the shipped app. Stores tokens in a
# plaintext local file, which is fine for a throwaway sandbox tool but
# should never be committed.
apps/quickbooks-oauth-quickstart/
